### add github dependabot repository
POST http://localhost:8080/github/repositories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RodrigoVitorino/SecDash-test"
}


### add github sast repository
POST http://localhost:8080/github/repositories
