###
// http://localhost:8080/oauth2/authorization/gitlab-api  authorize with gitlab for api access

// http://localhost:8080/gitlab/repos



### add dependancy-scanning gitlab repository
POST http://localhost:8080/gitlab/repositories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "80319756"
}


### add sast gitlab repo
POST http://localhost:8080/gitlab/repositories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "80515032"
}


### Github dependabot
GET http://localhost:8080/github/repositories/1/dependabot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### Gitlab dependancy-scanning
